  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When one has been without a certain pleasure for a number of years, one is accustomed to find on returning to it that it is not quite so delightful as one had imagined.",
      "output_sha256": "f997739e849d04d7cbe9ca0a3752a0fbecea628283bd6241df83dc2728c1a8d8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "f997739e849d04d7cbe9ca0a3752a0fbecea628283bd6241df83dc2728c1a8d8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "During the years away, the absence has allowed the imagination to embellish the experience, only for the real thing to reveal itself as somewhat mundane.",
      "output_sha256": "1e00aa057e285f758093207d1e76a156ed17a357b0ed6d21d83eee797ef32bb6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": 0.275814,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d02a0764abec3af0bb6f516a8a046a35206a4e4cd3d5b644a21bdcf6fb2a3768"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e00aa057e285f758093207d1e76a156ed17a357b0ed6d21d83eee797ef32bb6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Pleasant, yes; but, after all, nothing out of the ordinary.",
      "output_sha256": "dd39e49bf32cbca84d273586123d2370b73aac88d27497ed3156e3caba514c52",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "dd39e49bf32cbca84d273586123d2370b73aac88d27497ed3156e3caba514c52",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Most of us have made this discovery for ourselves in the last few months of peace.",
      "output_sha256": "5369c6409a6162587e64be0dff3f8aef0188058ac3c759d789c204a8d940158c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "5369c6409a6162587e64be0dff3f8aef0188058ac3c759d789c204a8d940158c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We have been doing the things which we had promised ourselves so often during the war, and though they have been jolly enough, they are not quite all that we dreamed in France and Flanders.",
      "output_sha256": "de512be2d0963b39db41d48d1765033935ebfc94db85763763e8da7f457f317d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_human_sha256": "de512be2d0963b39db41d48d1765033935ebfc94db85763763e8da7f457f317d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As for the negative pleasures, the pleasure of not saluting or not attending medical boards, they soon lose their first freshness.",
      "output_sha256": "61775ad24d11fea0e8a09a613f9705cf246c04b471754b4a3792dde25133f5ac",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "61775ad24d11fea0e8a09a613f9705cf246c04b471754b4a3792dde25133f5ac",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, I recently revisited a pre-war pleasure that exceeded my expectations entirely.",
      "output_sha256": "6f432daa1236f2b90f5019bd9c4b27cf9113882b509c99e3ef48cb27eb5a23d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.27428,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "68dee282a0f79b83097011fae507fde08b8c644bf8ba751e165b59352ce1ff09"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "6f432daa1236f2b90f5019bd9c4b27cf9113882b509c99e3ef48cb27eb5a23d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It was as good as I had thought it would be.",
      "output_sha256": "a53fd9394f7490353c352d0e8d18d55a98af64f1a518850f472afd71b68f8f7b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "a53fd9394f7490353c352d0e8d18d55a98af64f1a518850f472afd71b68f8f7b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I went to Lord's and watched first-class cricket again.",
      "output_sha256": "f9a8cbeac6fe45b3e4c0017d6b787a31a735fed2c80ffb4857df836bea5d8dfd",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_human_sha256": "f9a8cbeac6fe45b3e4c0017d6b787a31a735fed2c80ffb4857df836bea5d8dfd",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "There are individuals who seek to \"enhance cricket,\" which brings to mind a particular manager to whom I once submitted a play.",
      "output_sha256": "edba0a78dac4e9c1cadd443d4c8dee522ee73bbfec65041d4391ef5b6a5f59eb",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": 0.574242,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c78d92708daf29f7ba67859007a48216784ffecf4fe4d3dfffe9d41aec6f19f2",
        "4528f1f6dc7b47328f5efabe9988b91663215d58c6462008ee196ff0945a63c2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_ai_sha256": "edba0a78dac4e9c1cadd443d4c8dee522ee73bbfec65041d4391ef5b6a5f59eb",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        10
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He told me, more politely than truthfully, how much he had enjoyed reading it, and then pointed out what was wrong with the construction.",
      "output_sha256": "529795df8d362c8abcbd3bb84195accfef1ef976785633f488a381b83525ae59",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "529795df8d362c8abcbd3bb84195accfef1ef976785633f488a381b83525ae59",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"You have two brothers here,\" he said.",
      "output_sha256": "a2f6db256eec8e34d7658904d66455761f11df3c501bb22f1da337c3dc09fab2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 13,
      "source_human_sha256": "a2f6db256eec8e34d7658904d66455761f11df3c501bb22f1da337c3dc09fab2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"They oughtn't to have been brothers, they should have been strangers.",
      "output_sha256": "b15cbdffbbbc1b469f99052dc0f68115762eb37ef1e56c67471de823c532ff6e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "b15cbdffbbbc1b469f99052dc0f68115762eb37ef1e56c67471de823c532ff6e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Then one marries the heroine, which is incorrect; it should be the other brother who does.",
      "output_sha256": "642f97798739c822a5008c6c05e28e1681581b2560517fd07127a632d04f0966",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": 0.519529,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c875c337318315237302643db898045f64dcfe3339687f89ecc52370a6132362",
        "1ac14f1d0f464774ac3ada69a3748ef169119bbbf95b2ba84fc160b44aecf908"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "642f97798739c822a5008c6c05e28e1681581b2560517fd07127a632d04f0966",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Aunt Jane seems rather dull—what if she were arrested for bigamy?",
      "output_sha256": "0f7bcfbc78839f788ef83ce2f89968f2ee894098ec81c7206a2159d7b6ecd601",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.38869,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        17
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7de0701bf861b6f833873aa8ca51b5f68681e3157207173c5b21d4868823cd5c"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 15,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0f7bcfbc78839f788ef83ce2f89968f2ee894098ec81c7206a2159d7b6ecd601",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "And I’d cut out your third act entirely, moving the fourth act to Monte Carlo, with the heroine facing blackmail from—what’s his name?",
      "output_sha256": "4318b5e94e48b3a381b45c53f15cec41c3c51b9704ca104e9c8275a8446b8ffc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.378254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba8d91500bd3585f94d4318e953f8651356d5ab17a5714df546fc92cc94ddd7a",
        "5b11e945b9cec4159366b810008ccfba0a31fbd5cc85a99970984f3da6c3273e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "4318b5e94e48b3a381b45c53f15cec41c3c51b9704ca104e9c8275a8446b8ffc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Understand?\"",
      "output_sha256": "81ba22f42765160d6e11e303b9f2d2abe2134dad9ec1a95156e83f21a0b7b4d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": 0.378254,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        18,
        19
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ba8d91500bd3585f94d4318e953f8651356d5ab17a5714df546fc92cc94ddd7a",
        "5b11e945b9cec4159366b810008ccfba0a31fbd5cc85a99970984f3da6c3273e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_ai_sha256": "81ba22f42765160d6e11e303b9f2d2abe2134dad9ec1a95156e83f21a0b7b4d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I said that I saw.",
      "output_sha256": "ceba0fba4778f16f1c0183ea6f227abdc4e071ab3fe0a42b3d3710fe15e7719f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "ceba0fba4778f16f1c0183ea6f227abdc4e071ab3fe0a42b3d3710fe15e7719f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "\"Are you okay with my critiques?\" he asked casually.",
      "output_sha256": "622c3604de86b7f6e35d2f82723a8dd9e00140d456bf3e4200df9801fec72ce5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": 0.322105,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        21
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5c04fea04466aa3cc25940870b0ddaf8493c6bc35b1752986642931e1e5ec7e4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_ai_sha256": "622c3604de86b7f6e35d2f82723a8dd9e00140d456bf3e4200df9801fec72ce5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        19
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I replied that he wasn’t critiquing my work; he was crafting an entirely different story—one that I had no desire to create.",
      "output_sha256": "217a647f70baa06c79a837174c87e9e9096a1ab6dd6fe072e978f5179238ecdf",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": 0.38913,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "fbbbaa169eb371fd8091277b916b7a58206db59373c5c87084ccea15e25520cb",
        "1c29216d3215ed85199dfcca06d93426b9096e2eadc8b3bd471aeaa8a38cfb1e"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_ai_sha256": "217a647f70baa06c79a837174c87e9e9096a1ab6dd6fe072e978f5179238ecdf",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And this is what the brighteners of cricket are doing.",
      "output_sha256": "6cc34988dcdb2140df51b41ff7d91a3ea1db3453a9c7b32f86df80cdf1da999d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_human_sha256": "6cc34988dcdb2140df51b41ff7d91a3ea1db3453a9c7b32f86df80cdf1da999d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "They are inventing a new game, a game which those of us who love cricket have not the least desire to watch.",
      "output_sha256": "9da1b43e652feea3d73b81691800451ab239e7a31c69103ccf4fe4341a76b9be",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_human_sha256": "9da1b43e652feea3d73b81691800451ab239e7a31c69103ccf4fe4341a76b9be",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If anybody says that he finds Lord's or the Oval boring, I shall not be at all surprised; the only thing that would surprise me would be to hear that he found it more boring than I find Epsom or Newmarket.",
      "output_sha256": "ae0c60490be43989135480dfd92bf318fc286a95182191e91101c7aaa848f3f9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_human_sha256": "ae0c60490be43989135480dfd92bf318fc286a95182191e91101c7aaa848f3f9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Cricket doesn’t appeal to everyone, just as racing doesn't. Yet those who enjoy cricket appreciate it for what it is, without a desire for alterations from those who don’t share the same passion.",
      "output_sha256": "281dc2e0028641a479e7e123bb57147482aa7d0aa4f5a4e9dd956a1da637d7e7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.43676,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3fa2d79b6706ba5c01474385d7ee077a0715b62a513497852b74cb467af71372",
        "dcbc46abb58f05d3bf3694736452172cb32b816681d025da752bf4e0fb8b8b83"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "281dc2e0028641a479e7e123bb57147482aa7d0aa4f5a4e9dd956a1da637d7e7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Lord Lonsdale, I am sure, would hate me to brighten up Newmarket for him.",
      "output_sha256": "b8442551f8d7500aa881f969a56b1caaa9e9cc2d624c27226affc6a8d5e14b0a",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 29,
      "source_human_sha256": "b8442551f8d7500aa881f969a56b1caaa9e9cc2d624c27226affc6a8d5e14b0a",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Lord's as it is, which is as it was five years ago, is good enough for me.",
      "output_sha256": "37aa8a5f475614b14dca91947a09b4ce86719fafced7374c42b6d8f7ad674fa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "37aa8a5f475614b14dca91947a09b4ce86719fafced7374c42b6d8f7ad674fa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I would not alter any of it.",
      "output_sha256": "62585074033376471bbc5c74d75f9e99222e7e6fab64ab2f160504f1fce2a7cc",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "62585074033376471bbc5c74d75f9e99222e7e6fab64ab2f160504f1fce2a7cc",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To hear the pavilion bell ring out again was to hear the most musical sound in the world.",
      "output_sha256": "791f2d4b5a9c148dc5073d2dd46b973e87ac98da35d5eb72278ee5e3d9412ac5",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "791f2d4b5a9c148dc5073d2dd46b973e87ac98da35d5eb72278ee5e3d9412ac5",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The best note is given at 11.20 in the morning; later on it lacks something of its early ecstasy.",
      "output_sha256": "e60324b7839d65dd59da6887846bfbc46e15c6a8b171fe7dd11ce835ef11d469",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "e60324b7839d65dd59da6887846bfbc46e15c6a8b171fe7dd11ce835ef11d469",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "When people talk of the score of this or that opera I smile pityingly to myself.",
      "output_sha256": "93d8289c814b104401bfe9df4fe1c5f9119ca621d18a8a4a3c2b4aed05661108",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "93d8289c814b104401bfe9df4fe1c5f9119ca621d18a8a4a3c2b4aed05661108",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "They have yet to experience true music.",
      "output_sha256": "ebfc902fdb8ab501d10dfcee1e69b0e234dafbb5b193dee1c1b1cc2dcca9d579",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": 0.607143,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "37da9a5ced5ea5a3ee9ec0c1ec60e41209a934e80d483b9c42d60833b2860405"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ebfc902fdb8ab501d10dfcee1e69b0e234dafbb5b193dee1c1b1cc2dcca9d579",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        31
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The sound of ice clinking against glass can be pleasant on a fine day, but it pales in comparison to the magic of the Lord's bell.",
      "output_sha256": "03f4ae988b472f12ccf4549bf1d21929b6b8197ff684151971bd7b95811c8134",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": 0.629661,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "5d9db733a8f67b686ab7e0d91a4a321bb39cfdaede2f3b584852152f4483011d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_ai_sha256": "03f4ae988b472f12ccf4549bf1d21929b6b8197ff684151971bd7b95811c8134",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As was my habit on these occasions five years ago, I bought a copy of The Daily Telegraph on entering the ground.",
      "output_sha256": "41c86bbf410e7dc809b63b7204d669c6fe5a926738c8f53c2f798980a1c5c8aa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "41c86bbf410e7dc809b63b7204d669c6fe5a926738c8f53c2f798980a1c5c8aa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In the ordinary way I do not take in this paper, but I have always had a warm admiration for it, holding it to have qualities which place it far above any other London journal of similar price.",
      "output_sha256": "0fb2c28840a87aa73cd7057ee35fc3791b11d748d4ba904299099571156051c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "0fb2c28840a87aa73cd7057ee35fc3791b11d748d4ba904299099571156051c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "For the seats at Lord's are uncommonly hard, and a Daily Telegraph, folded twice and placed beneath one, brings something of the solace which good literature will always bring.",
      "output_sha256": "70082dfc326ec2115bf0d62c1ddc96963e6ad9e76a623bc5ca42b4f52bc68559",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "70082dfc326ec2115bf0d62c1ddc96963e6ad9e76a623bc5ca42b4f52bc68559",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "My friends had noticed before the war, without being able to account for it, that my views became noticeably more orthodox as the summer advanced, only to fall away again with the approach of autumn.",
      "output_sha256": "469767a6a7320fa68dad42f2da83a0e7595521f9d4a47205b0e1f8d762afb2e4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "469767a6a7320fa68dad42f2da83a0e7595521f9d4a47205b0e1f8d762afb2e4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I must have been influenced subconsciously by the leading articles.",
      "output_sha256": "97f7a1a38b4da63b237f673050cdaefa9ec67b3ba5c572842f3f2daca4b3cdad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "97f7a1a38b4da63b237f673050cdaefa9ec67b3ba5c572842f3f2daca4b3cdad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It rained, and play was stopped for an hour or two.",
      "output_sha256": "aaf99224b69a2a67cd9efd89c188ebd4722cf9475c6debebbc18c21ea0ffce23",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_human_sha256": "aaf99224b69a2a67cd9efd89c188ebd4722cf9475c6debebbc18c21ea0ffce23",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In the past, I would have been irritated by this and would have lamented my bad luck.",
      "output_sha256": "1c4f9524c6085288ee5d353478fcd54ff418256883093d420459f50ed0ac8362",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": 0.383666,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d0c7bbc4bdf32365bb48c4ddab4363504377d8b9b421d1a5f62ea11d8a681dfd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1c4f9524c6085288ee5d353478fcd54ff418256883093d420459f50ed0ac8362",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "But this time, I felt fortunate to be reliving all the familiar sensations in a single day.",
      "output_sha256": "370fd11d0159adec11257e8ed2b1b1b065b1b99c4b11127157e4a7a31306d1ed",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": 0.478947,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        44
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "6b5dff67bbf7a6048bc8e11c9fd55af2571d815e8f5fc4c8f98104be5b9aa8dd"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_ai_sha256": "370fd11d0159adec11257e8ed2b1b1b065b1b99c4b11127157e4a7a31306d1ed",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It was delightful to witness the clouds parting and hear the crowd erupting in applause at the first signs of clearing skies; to cheer the brave umpires when they finally decided to inspect the pitch; to observe the groundsmen springing into action, indicating a favorable decision; and to see the umpires, dressed in white coats, return with the ball and bails.",
      "output_sha256": "dfc5067fd2fdc5da3983479977ffac1229b8bd09e3c4551c3ef0c21ceefe4c66",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.470951,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3db1da3483ff0b95da0e19b0acb861fe10a19b4075ed98ce6fe68db07534813"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_ai_sha256": "dfc5067fd2fdc5da3983479977ffac1229b8bd09e3c4551c3ef0c21ceefe4c66",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41,
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Then, we could settle back into the rhythm of the day’s play.",
      "output_sha256": "fb36969077a952408b998a59bbd43ca2cbf81684c5330e109fdd43b9e0d6d296",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.470951,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d3db1da3483ff0b95da0e19b0acb861fe10a19b4075ed98ce6fe68db07534813"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "fb36969077a952408b998a59bbd43ca2cbf81684c5330e109fdd43b9e0d6d296",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        41,
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps the cricket was slow from the point of view of the follower of league football, but I do not feel that this is any condemnation of it.",
      "output_sha256": "031f2b49ebfd6f7aef91574ca2509c4c6a3b79557fd521646be22c9fd462628e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "031f2b49ebfd6f7aef91574ca2509c4c6a3b79557fd521646be22c9fd462628e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "An essay of Lamb's would be slow to a reader of William le Queux's works, who wanted a new body in each chapter.",
      "output_sha256": "60ae8335289097604010398d02349fb455cee022dde094b9d497f1aad3a6d1e0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "60ae8335289097604010398d02349fb455cee022dde094b9d497f1aad3a6d1e0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I shall not quarrel with anyone who holds that a day at Lord's is a dull day; if he thinks so, let him take his amusement elsewhere.",
      "output_sha256": "55e53154ec87a6386b17f86fd08427ee6fac095179812ad9863d485b9cb55fa0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 48,
      "source_human_sha256": "55e53154ec87a6386b17f86fd08427ee6fac095179812ad9863d485b9cb55fa0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But let him not quarrel with me, because I keep to my opinion, as firmly now as before the war, that a day at Lord's is a joyous day.",
      "output_sha256": "2ca2ee33444d3de3a09ae3a265375ae92258fc036d7231f568ebef71b3c64942",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "2ca2ee33444d3de3a09ae3a265375ae92258fc036d7231f568ebef71b3c64942",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "If he will leave me the old Lord's, I will promise not to brighten his football for him.",
      "output_sha256": "fdf6af7914900bbd452456cb712d9cfbb472604fcb3d39db643a567cc7bff2b8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "fdf6af7914900bbd452456cb712d9cfbb472604fcb3d39db643a567cc7bff2b8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
